# Proposed evidence-tool components; none is implemented or qualified by this design.
direction: down
classes: {
  start: {style: {fill: "#25364B"; font-color: "#FFFFFF"; bold: true; stroke-width: 3}}
}
Start: "Start here · Proposed attempt coordinator\nRequired fixed authority + independent admission + fresh export\nPure gate cannot issue live target permission" {class: start}
Admission: "External checker + pinned admission verifier\nFixed register / direct review / independent self-controls\nFresh nonce + domain-bound channel · no success token"
Authority: "Proposed separate KoineReferenceEvidence lifecycle\nFresh export → consume.intent → spent.receipt → original start\nNo cleanup refund; actual receipt / approved register absent"
Gate: "Always-present native contact gate\nExact entry / live-channel refusal design unresolved\nFull IPC / proxy bypass evidence required"
Source: "Fixed source adapter\nmdfind -0 · exact predicate · raw stdout / stderr\nSlot ordinals + actual terminal / reap"
Held: "Held acquisition adapter\nComponent scope / protected + outside-intermediate refusal\nClosed layouts / fixed files / direct locales"
Objects: "Original evidence objects\nComplete bytes or exact failed prefixes\nEvery source / copy / file / alias occurrence retained"
Decoder: "In-process Core Foundation decoder\nFormat / error + complete type-ID walk\nUTF-16 / data / exact number and date observations"
Envelope: "Closed proposed envelope version 1\nTrees / candidates / flags / tables / LocProvenance\nJoint tails + item-by-item closure + frozen tools"
Oracle: "Separately frozen independent expectations\nFormat-derived / CF-corroborated / regression-only\nRequired inventory + intended negative coordinates"
Observer: "Unprivileged independent full contact boundary required\nNo root / sudo; full universe / coverage unresolved\nDTrace partial only; wrapper trace cannot replace it"
Verifier: "Independent offline verifier\nRecompute every coordinate; totals are not the oracle\nOriginal hashes cannot qualify generated rewrites"
Boundary: "K274 lifecycle + k275 anchor proposals; k276 / k277 / k278 live\nWhole k273 review → k269; register / receipt / contact proofs absent\nTarget pass unused · private eligibility / native verdict pending"
Start -> Admission: "1 · independently complete invocation proof"
Admission -> Authority: "2 · checked export / destructive permit consumption"
Authority -> Gate: "3 · persisted start before contact"
Gate -> Source: "4a · fixed query or scratch emitter"
Gate -> Held: "4b · scope-checked descriptors or scratch"
Source -> Held: "5 · complete framed terminal response"
Held -> Objects: "6 · no-follow reads and raw observations"
Objects -> Decoder: "7 · bytes only; no target pathname"
Objects -> Envelope: "8a · originals stay separate"
Decoder -> Envelope: "8b · full witness or explicit typed failure"
Envelope -> Verifier: "9a · package and all associations"
Oracle -> Verifier: "9b · independent expected facts"
Source -> Observer: "actual scratch pipe syscalls"
Held -> Observer: "actual scratch descriptor syscalls"
Observer -> Verifier: "external bypass / no-contact evidence"
Verifier -> Boundary: "10 · construction must observe all controls"
